with your icebreaker and then lead them to safer waters.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138340/extras/c43a44d1703f220b9703e062e3e41ebe.poster.avif?t=1732914446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138340/extras/c43a44d1703f220b9703e062e3e41ebe.webm?t=1732914446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138340/extras/c43a44d1703f220b9703e062e3e41ebe.mp4?t=1732914446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Machine operation</strong><br>The goods will not discharge itself! Sometimes it is not enough to reach a specific place, the customer may require you to unload the raw material or containers to the appropriate place in the port <br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138340/extras/dc512d82312e56092c2078526cd1e1a0.poster.avif?t=1732914446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138340/extras/dc512d82312e56092c2078526cd1e1a0.webm?t=1732914446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138340/extras/dc512d82312e56092c2078526cd1e1a0.mp4?t=1732914446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Get the right tool for the job</strong><br>Pick from a wide spectrum of real equipment. Proper usage of tools is a key to success at sea.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138340/extras/b8a6b18413151bdee55af3b5ea186dfb.poster.avif?t=1732914446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/